    "2 teaspoons bagel seasoning (such as Trader Joe's Everything but the Bagel Sesame Seasoning Blend )",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh rosemary"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
